  "title": "Make Battle Start Effects Seamless [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "戦闘開始演出をシームレスにする【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "11235dc445d129a359301456a8b27f168f3764c9e6d8c1833d424402e72f5006",
      "translation": "Make Battle Start Effects Seamless [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "11235dc445d129a359301456a8b27f168f3764c9e6d8c1833d424402e72f5006"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "暗転を挟まないシームレスな戦闘開始演出を提供します。",
      "sourceHash": "28a1d46509d8ae65ea99c4ebbcf8c891f45ad46f3adb7309b76f10b0c7592884",
      "translation": "Provides a seamless battle start effect without a fade to black.",
      "contextHash": "28a1d46509d8ae65ea99c4ebbcf8c891f45ad46f3adb7309b76f10b0c7592884"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ズームや回転などの演出も同時に可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "bd2c0c28eb6d3d168730f5f13f079393101dd674e31098845692d0a3971fe07e",
      "translation": "Effects such as zooming and rotation can also be applied simultaneously.",
      "contextHash": "bd2c0c28eb6d3d168730f5f13f079393101dd674e31098845692d0a3971fe07e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、シームレスといっても最低限のロード時間は必要となります。特にゲームを開始してから初回の戦闘では、読み込むデータ量が多くなるのでローディングが発生しやすいです。",
      "sourceHash": "bbdb5968b5b61b0af484a0037ce0d0ff23f6b80c4749c86c2b187901b91cc1b3",
      "translation": "However, even a seamless transition requires a minimum amount of loading time. In particular, the first battle after starting the game is more likely to involve loading because a larger amount of data must be loaded.",
      "contextHash": "bbdb5968b5b61b0af484a0037ce0d0ff23f6b80c4749c86c2b187901b91cc1b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なので、初期状態ではズームおよび回転演出を入れることでごまかしています。",
      "sourceHash": "80022e8a9384defebd9b9d3ea4b4eb151823ad7bc7b7d30598666d972a66d29a",
      "translation": "Therefore, the default settings disguise this by adding zoom and rotation effects.",
      "contextHash": "80022e8a9384defebd9b9d3ea4b4eb151823ad7bc7b7d30598666d972a66d29a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_SeamlessEncounter.js",
      "sourceHash": "d90966638e3b53411f6535b2a2f59172fb5e15beb343cd92e66ceef17ff2622d",
      "translation": "NRP_SeamlessEncounter.js ",
      "contextHash": "a479831ec7c66657e136102789982842edd22c2c5839ce17302b471b95463922"
    },
    {
